# Pairs with RestoreAllOrNothing. The coordinator commits once ANY participant
# voted yes, so one cluster cuts over while another has already compensated.
MODULE: RestoreAllOrNothingCommitsOnPartialVote
TARGET: RestoreAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the decision commits without a unanimous yes
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
         /\ d = "commit" => \A c \in Clusters : vote[c] = "yes"
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: one yes suffices.
         /\ d = "commit" => \E c \in Clusters : vote[c] = "yes"
--- END
